  "description": "Provider-agnostic payment billing for ASP.NET Core. Hosted checkout and verified webhooks for Stripe, YooKassa, Shopify and Telegram Stars, plus external donation platforms (Ko-fi, Patreon, manual Boosty) with claim-code attribution and an unclaimed-purchase holding area - all behind one IBillingProvider seam with pluggable payment store and fulfillment. Targets net5.0 through net11.0.",
